  "title": "Mom&#39;s Best Peanut Brittle",
  "description": "This homemade peanut brittle is easy to make with this foolproof recipe for a sweet, salty, crunchy treat that wows everyone, every time! Great for gifts.",
  "authors": [
    "Amanda"
  ],
